{"v":4,"catch":"特殊的狂暴技巧！\n掌握無敵碾壓！","desc":"《ZING ZING ZIP》是ALLUMER於1992年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n操作垂直移動速度快的1P飛機或水平移動速度快的2P飛機來擊敗邪惡帝國。\n通過充分利用各種物品和滾動特殊動作來清除屏幕，使您無敵或在激活時增強力量。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2023-09-07","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/06f8fc9dd26b508aba20ed06f33273a75f31c5baf0d3b09e8de70f826dc3c76e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c1b99d3883828ca69f69bdf7e5e74791e70cd03793caab9b22c74a7edcf86719.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/556d59e93b2dd36364988cb02423ab18aba79f8b87c06b9d095eb6044dac72b9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/996f2a8bbe2d471b5b34c6f313ee08c0d05134b3c2e1184f1c81330217547cce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de54f9714bfda75f79045e2236bc6f99fc63ff4c72bb42d8f395d57e41ff2a52.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7c2b52ecdacdb2fbc11a9821b3c452f250674a881d13ca0ef8467724270e150e.jpg"],"titleId":"01004f701c14e000","dlc":[]}